WEBVTT

1
00:00.150 --> 00:05.264
Ask Mythic any yes-or-no question.

2
00:05.564 --> 00:11.026
Sometimes the answer comes back Exceptional.

3
00:11.476 --> 00:16.147
Mythic interrupts the Scene you expected.

4
00:16.447 --> 00:23.100
Then a Random Event changes the story.

5
00:23.550 --> 00:34.246
Meaning Tables give you two words to interpret.

6
00:34.696 --> 00:45.391
Roll your game's dice, labeled and colored.

7
00:45.841 --> 00:53.720
Reread your session in the Adventure Log.

8
00:54.120 --> 01:00.000
Mythic GME Apps
Official Mythic GM Emulator apps. Now 1.7.
In Mythic GME Mobile, some features need the Expanded Features in-app purchase.
